#' Synthetic complete incubation observations
#'
#' A reproducible simulation of 200 independent infected individuals who
#' develop symptoms, using the Lessler model. These are artificial observations,
#' not patient data, and cannot validate the model against clinical outcomes.
#'
#' @format A data frame with 200 rows and two columns:
#' \describe{
#'   \item{id}{Integer simulation identifier.}
#'   \item{incubation_days}{Complete time from infection to symptoms, in days.}
#' }
#' @source Generated by `data-raw/incubation_example.R` with seed 20260323,
#'   Mersenne-Twister uniform RNG and Inversion normal RNG.
#' @seealso [r_incubation()], [incubation_model()], [plot_incubation_data()]
#' @examples
#' summary(incubation_example$incubation_days)
#' mean(incubation_example$incubation_days <= 14)
#' p_incubation(14)
"incubation_example"
